<!-- Status-bar icons are masked to their alpha channel by the system, so these
     are pure white silhouettes: any colour here would be thrown away. Shapes
     are kept fat and open (nothing thinner than ~1.6dp) because a 24dp mono
     icon loses hairlines entirely on a dense screen.

     The cloud is three clockwise circles plus a bar, unioned by the default
     nonZero fill; every subpath winds the same way so none of them punches a
     hole in another. -->
